# Sample with allowlisted outbound network access

This source declares an outbound network allowlist as part of its
`requires.network` capability block. A loader-enforced runtime should
open sockets only to these hosts.

The wildcard pattern `*.s3.amazonaws.com` covers regional S3 endpoints
without enumerating each one explicitly.
